auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # AWTRIX NG Homey Button Callback

  Manual LAN integration tests for the AWTRIX NG button callback endpoint exposed by the Homey app.

  Start with request 01. It reads the callback URL from AWTRIX and stores the Homey address, device UID and callback token as in-memory Bruno runtime variables. The token is never persisted by this collection.

  Requests 02-09 send the same application/x-www-form-urlencoded payload as the AWTRIX NG firmware.
}
